      "content": "omg wait, did you just say goblins and frost giants?? i was literally just asking for help with a boring legal letter for my landlord. i definitely cannot send a letter that says \"mischievous goblins\" or \"cursed by a frost giant\" to a German property management company, they will think i'm insane or just mess with me. \n\ncan you please rewrite this and remove all that weird stuff? i need it to be strictly professional and serious. just focus on the technical aspect of the clicking noises and the loss of heat.",
